{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in a space setting. Your main task is to complete each level without hitting any obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the pilot of a spaceship flying along a metal spline by the action of a magnetic cushion, which can rotate around the spline. Some obstacles are destructible. Such obstacles need to be smashed with a weapon or melted with a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is very beautiful and unique. Listen to the music and play in unison with it. The levels last an average of 3 minutes. Each of them has checkpoints that save the current progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FastFly has a short story and a manual that describes all the functions and mechanics of the game (as the levels become more complex, new and/or more complex mechanics appear). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also purchase various coatings for your spaceship and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814610?t=1750426115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/d75748cb8f67a10f659fb16e34776d88f93f92b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750426115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/6f96618de27ad44d31cb02a1986bec18465264ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750426115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/6f96618de27ad44d31cb02a1986bec18465264ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750426115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in a space setting. Your main task is to complete each level without hitting any obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the pilot of a spaceship flying along a metal spline by the action of a magnetic cushion, which can rotate around the spline. Some obstacles are destructible. Such obstacles need to be smashed with a weapon or melted with a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is very beautiful and unique. Listen to the music and play in unison with it. The levels last an average of 3 minutes. Each of them has checkpoints that save the current progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FastFly has a short story and a manual that describes all the functions and mechanics of the game (as the levels become more complex, new and/or more complex mechanics appear). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also purchase various coatings for your spaceship and more.</p>","developers":["NanoFastFly"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814610/bf2e21e3a3c07ec63ff684a8c4e87bd397c398fe/header.jpg?t=1750426115","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157417,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157417/movie480.mp4?t=1750085399","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157417/movie_max.mp4?t=1750085399"},"name":"FastFly trailer v1.0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157417/93d63e41b407de6bd51f58d3b3cde9ef923d35d8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750085399","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157417/movie480_v